tica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;\">Together with</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <a href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-vibe1?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=stripe-acquires-openrouter-for-7b\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/3eaafe73-a5c4-4a7a-beb3-87739b1df2e5/viktor_logo_top__4_.png?t=1786974410\"></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;padding:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">howdy, it’s Barsee again.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">happy monday, AI family, and welcome back to AI Valley.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>here are the biggest things worth knowing today:</b></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:37px;padding-right:27px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <ul style=\"color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Roboto',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px 0px 0px 25px;padding:0;\">\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Stripe is reportedly buying OpenRouter</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Anthropic may be sitting on a model it’s not willing to release</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">A guy may have solved a 22-year-old math problem with ChatGPT</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Plus trending AI tools, posts, and resources</p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Let’s <i>dive</i> into the Valley of AI…</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#222222;border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;margin:0.0px 7.0px 9.0px 7.0px;padding:10.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:Normal;font-size:15px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.125;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:#00bd52;\"><b>VIKTOR</b></span></h4>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:6px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:3px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:500;font-size:26px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-vibe1-hl?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=stripe-acquires-openrouter-for-7b\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">First there was vibecoding. Now there's vibe deploying.</a></h2>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n    <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n     <img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/a94523c0-4e8c-4d18-9085-e75ad9ac787c/aivalley_vibe2_1280x720__2_.jpg?t=1786974361\">\n     <div style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;padding:4px 0px 4px 0px;text-align:left;width:100%;\">\n      <small style=\"color:#000000;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:italic;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\"> \n       <p>Courtesy: Viktor.com</p> \n      </small>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Vibe deploying is getting paid to put AI employees to work inside real businesses.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">AI labs pay forward deployed engineers six figures to install AI at big companies. Millions of smaller businesses get nobody. That gap just became a job anyone can take.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Viktor is the AI employee that 50,000+ teams run inside Slack and Microsoft Teams. You set Viktor up for clients. People charge $3,000 to $10,000 per setup and keep all of it. You earn 20% of everything each client spends for 12 months. You collect an activation bonus of up to $2,000 per client.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Five clients work out to roughly $44K to $79K in year one. Example numbers; results vary.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">One founding specialist reported six figures in revenue in his first 30 days.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Free to join. No engineering degree.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>Apply for free at&nbsp;</b><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-vibe1?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=stripe-acquires-openrouter-for-7b\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\"><b>viktor.com/experts</b></a><b>&nbsp;→</b></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:right;\"><sub><i>*This is sponsored</i></sub></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#222222;border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;margin:0.0px 7.0px 9.0px 7.0px;padding:10.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:Normal;font-size:15px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.125;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:#00bd52;\"><b>THROUGH THE VALLEY</b></span></h4>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n    <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n     <img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/cf5cc97d-cc01-4f0c-a976-128582566217/133285795__1_.png?t=1786978185\">\n     <div style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;padding:4px 0px 4px 0px;text-align:left;width:100%;\">\n      <small style=\"color:#000000;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:italic;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\"> \n       <p>AI-generated image</p> \n      </small>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>1/ Stripe is reportedly buying OpenRouter for more than $7 billion:</b> Stripe has reportedly agreed to acquire the AI infrastructure startup for more than <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-16/stripe-nears-deal-to-buy-ai-firm-openrouter-for-over-7-billion?accessToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzb3VyY2UiOiJTdWJzY3JpYmVyR2lmdGVkQXJ0aWNsZSIsImlhdCI6MTc4NjkzODUzMCwiZXhwIjoxNzg3NTQzMzMwLCJhcnRpY2xlSWQiOiJUSThMNlJLSVVQUzAwMCIsImJjb25uZWN0SWQiOiIwOThFNzNDQTE5QTA0RDkxODEyQzQ4MjcwRDZERTI0QiJ9.pkZkmbMn4rGnxII2FL6UJUYi35K78_NwpKpHwiGCWCQ&amp;utm_source=tldrnewsletter&amp;leadSource=article-gifting\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">$7 billion</a>, just months after OpenRouter was valued at around $1.3 billion. The platform gives developers access to 400+ AI models and 8 million developers, making it easy to switch providers when one is cheaper or more reliable. For Stripe, the deal could be a huge bet on owning the infrastructure layer behind the AI boom.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>2/ Anthropic may be sitting on a model it’s not willing to release:</b> The company says it has no plans to launch “<a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/08/14/anthropic-model-2-ai-risk?utm_content=primary_anthropic_model2&amp;utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=stripe-acquires-openrouter-for-7b\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Model 2</a>,” an internal system that reportedly outperforms its current top models at coding, agentic work, and data generation. Anthropic has also raised its estimated risk of misalignment in high-stakes situations from “very low” to “low” and says its models are getting better at automated R&amp;D. The interesting part isn’t just how powerful the model is, but that Anthropic apparently thinks releasing it could be a bad idea.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>3/ A neurosurgery resident may have solved a 22-year-old math problem with ChatGPT:</b> Beijing neurosurgery resident Shanmu Jin says GPT-5.6 Sol produced a proof of <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://github.com/jinshanmu/CrouzeixConjecture?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=stripe-acquires-openrouter-for-7b\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Crouzeix’s Conjecture</a> during a 16-hour autonomous session in ChatGPT Work. Jin isn’t a professional mathematician and taught himself advanced math after studying geology and medicine, while several experts have independently checked the proof. Formal peer review is still pending, but if the proof holds up, the bigger story may be that AI is making advanced mathematical discovery accessible to people who never trained as mathematicians.</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border-bottom-left-radius:0px;padding:7.0px 2.0px 7.0px 2.0px;margin:15.0px 2.0px 0.0px 2.0px;border-top-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-color:#222222;border-top-right-radius:15px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:4px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:4px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:27px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\">TRENDING TOOLS</h1>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:15px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#222222;border-left-width:1px;border-right-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-top-width:0px;margin:0.0px 2.0px 15.0px 2.0px;padding:2.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:37px;padding-right:27px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <ul style=\"color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Roboto',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px 0px 0px 25px;padding:0;\">\n     <l